[D3] LARGEST SIZES ACTUALLY REACHED IN THIS LANE, AND WHAT STOPPED EACH:
     ROUTE 1, exact Walsh over all blocks .............. m = 20  (2^20 = 1048576 blocks)
                stopped by: 2^m blocks; m = 22 is 4x this and m = 24 is 16x.
     ROUTE 2, exact O(g^2) orbital sum, 1D ............. m = 8192 mediator sites
                stopped by: dense O(m^3) eigendecomposition and an m^2 eigenvector array.
     ROUTE 2, 2D mediator .............................. 63 x 64 = 4032 sites
     ROUTE 2, 3D mediator .............................. 15 x 16 x 17 = 4080 sites
     Full dense ED of the 2^(2m) carrier ............... 2m = 12 qubits (dim 4096)
                stopped by: the 4^(2m) exhaustive Pauli search, not by the ED.
     Diagonal-exact clause check, Part 1 ............... n = 16 (dim 65536)
     Exhaustive Pauli search, Part 1 ................... n = 10 (4^10 = 1048576 Paulis)
